	(text "J3 XUNPU D-SUB-DR-9PCG-BB: DB9 male (pins), right angle,\n4-40 shell, KiCad DSUB-9 footprint (EdgePinOffset 7.70 mm).\nPinout per the IPC: 1 = GND, 3 = CAN_H, 5 = CAN_L, the rest open.\nShell / mounting holes to GND (as the RJ45 shield).\nMale on the board and on the IPC: use a straight-through\nfemale-female DB9 cable (1-1, 3-3, 5-5).\nNot the CiA 303-1 DB9 pinout (2 CAN_L, 7 CAN_H, 3 GND):\na standard CAN DB9 cable or adapter will not match.\nD6 H24VNT2B: ESD at the connector, no series R (CIF rule 8)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 88.9 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "15377bbe-da7e-562c-9ab8-e8a30dfbf257")
	)
